WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.400
Hi, hello, hello. We're House House.

2
00:00:04.400 --> 00:00:07.000
We made Untitled Goose Game, and we also made this game we're playing right now.

3
00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:10.000
It's called Big Walk, and it just came out today.

4
00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:12.000
Hooray!

5
00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:18.000
It's a place for friends to have a big adventure that's about finding new ways to talk to each other.

6
00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:24.000
We love all the funny little ways that people find to communicate in online games, and wanted to make a whole game out of doing that.

7
00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:30.160
So we made these expressive characters, put them in a big open world, and filled it with challenges to get you talking.

8
00:00:30.160 --> 00:00:37.760
With your hands, walkie-talkies, body language, fireworks, megaphones, cowbells, or just yelling.

9
00:00:37.760 --> 00:00:40.880
No matter if you're playing with one other person or as part of a big group,

10
00:00:40.880 --> 00:00:43.600
the focus of the game is always on the people you're playing with.

11
00:00:43.600 --> 00:00:45.000
And we think that's a really special feeling.

12
00:00:46.000 --> 00:00:50.000
We've been working on Big Walk for six years now, and we still love playing it together.

13
00:00:50.000 --> 00:00:52.000
We hope you will too.

14
00:00:52.000 --> 00:00:56.000
And now you can, because Big Walk is out now. Have fun.

15
00:00:56.000 --> 00:00:58.000
All right, bye.
